OCPROJECT 1
# Particle test content, wave 10 (docs/PARTICLES.md). Lives in the repo, is not a demo game and uses no third-party assets.
# Open it and press Play: Maps/ParticleDemo.ocworld places six emitters (Embers, FireSmoke, SparkTrails, BeamRibbon,
# Debris, Rain100k). The two older effects, Snowfall and Mist, are the version-1 files that prove v1 still loads unchanged.
# It also proves the asset-RESOLUTION path (loadProjectParticleEffects, both composition roots): the log line
# "[Particles] N project effect(s) loaded" and each placed emitter resolving through fnv1a64 of its content-relative path.
# Headed check: Settings > Render > Performance > Particles on GPU = Off / Auto / On, or the --particles-cpu / --particles-gpu flags.
NAME ParticleDemo
ENGINE Aver 0.7.0-1
CREATEDWITH 0.7.0-1
CONTENT Content
STARTMAP Maps/ParticleDemo.ocworld
